Header: { "alg":"RS256", "typ":"JWT", "kid":"<key-id>" }
Payload: {
  "iss":"<idp-issuer>",
  "aud":"<realm-token-endpoint>",
  "sub":"<user-id>",
  "exp":..., "iat":...,
  "requested_scope":"email.send"
}
Sign with RSA private key, kid header matches KC's publicKeySignatureVerifierKeyId.

200 OK
{ "access_token": "<JWT>", "scope": "email.send email.modify email profile calendar.read calendar.write" }
⚠️ KC 26.6.4 broker jwt-bearer ignores scope param; returns union of all client scopes.
